Z||000002||tgowens||04-21-2001||11:31 AM||||Bill, I have made the comments on your posts simply to keep the membership here enlightened and informed........in one of the posts I replied to you said <B>"There was a post a while back about repair shops that will work on Fieros, and where to find good shops..........For all you Bay Area members."</B> - I replied to that post because you had made the inference that those were the <B><I>only</I></B> shops in the bay area to work on Fieros -- I felt that was misleading and inaccurate since we are also located in the Bay Area of San Francisco. <P>It has been evident for quite some time that you personally do not like George - that has been evident at events we have attended and also with the newsletter fiasco of late.......now, that is your prerogative to dislike someone for whatever reason you choose but.......to intentionally mislead the public because of that dislike. <P>I simply made the statements due to, what I felt was inaccurate reporting on your part in the erroneous omission of Fiero Shop as a Bay Area shop that works on Fieros. When, In fact, we specialize in the Fiero and are the <B>only</B> shop in the northwestern United States to do so.......I would say that was a pretty large omission on your part -- those kinds of omissions are made with implied malice to injure an individual or their business.<P>OK, enough said - you wondered why I had made the statements.........those are my reasons why - I felt that you were intentionally omitting Fiero Shop from "Bay Area" shops in an effort to steer business to your buddies shops. While selling the merits of a shop are admirable, they should not be done with the implication that those are the only shops someone can go to to have their Fiero serviced..........The customer has a right to pick and choose and should be made aware of <B>ALL</B> Bay Area shops if that is what your topic caption is..........||||reg||1
Z||000003||tgowens||04-21-2001||11:36 AM||||oh, by the way, Bill.........you said, "I feel that you and George want to play this little game So, if you want to play I'm game!!!"...........I am not, nor do I, play games - the Fiero Shop is a business and not where games are played. If you want to play games about personalities that is up to you but, please keep it off of the public Forum.........and don't try to influence others with your way of thinking.......<P>No, I have not ever said anything derogatory, either on here or to you (which <I>is</I> the way I would do it...........)about you or anything you have done - you must have me confused with someone else.......||||reg||1
