Z||000005||DXR_DAD||04-21-2001||12:21 PM||||Your right Terry this is a PUBLIC forum and that means I can say what I feel at any time! and if by me saying something and it in has an influence on others then so be it.<P>I have tried to stay out of any of the fiero shops dealings, I do not reply to any of your post, I did not reply to any of you posts to my topics until this!<P>So maybe it should be made public!! <BR>Or maybe I should post the many Emails I have from your <B>DISSATISFIED customers!!!</B> Then maybe we can talk about Business<P>"DON'T START NON....WON'T BE NON"<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||1
Z||000006||tgowens||04-21-2001||02:10 PM||||Bill, maybe you should re-read <I>my</I> post - I didn't say that you <I>said</I> that those were the only shops but rather that your post was worded in such a careful manner as to <I>imply</I> that they were - now, if you want to get nasty about all of this I'm sure that it will only show character - as for me, I have not gotten nasty nor will I do so. My character and integrity speak for themselves.........<P>Your simple statement "Or maybe I should post the many Emails I have from your DISSATISFIED customers!!! Then maybe we can talk about Business" speaks volumes of what this is all about.... you want to turn it into something ugly - all I have said here is that you failed to mention the Fiero Shop when notifying Forum members (Bay Area Members I think you said) of the shops in the Bay Area (and we <I>are</I> in the bay area) that work on Fieros - all I did was simply to amend your post to remind you that we too are located in the Bay Area and we specialize in the Fiero - now, if you want to take that and run with it and further your feud with George then that is certainly up to you -- to drag me into it is not befitting good character.<P>As far as dissatisfied customers goes, many businesses have them for a variety of reasons - that's part of doing business and it is very difficult to satisfy everyone all the time even though you strive to do so. But, why they would email <I>you</I> rather than us is beyond me -- no matter what the problem, it cannot be rectified until it is brought to out attention -- to complain to a third party does no good unless that person's sole intent was to degrade rather than to rectify............<P>Enough said..........<P><p>[This message has been edited by tgowens (edited 04-21-2001).]||||reg||1
